('BRAND_IMAGE_FREEPBX_LINK_LEFT','http://www.freepbx.org','Link for Left Logo',1,'link to follow when clicking on logo, defaults to http://www.freepbx.org','text','','http://www.freepbx.org',1,0,'Styling and Logos','',1,100),
